 ineffective for ordinary rich PM items and cannot approach the 100k to 1M scale contract."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:search","area:semantic","batching","ollama","performance","qwen3","scale","vectorization"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-28T20:35:34.770Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-28T20:35:34.770Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-12-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":480},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Separate per-input corpus truncation from provider request byte and token budgets; negotiate or configure safe multi-input request limits per provider and model; preserve deterministic input to vector ordering under parallelism adaptive split retry and resume; expose effective batch count size distribution throughput ETA provider model and limit sources in the receipt; add timeout payload-too-large partial-failure and restart negative controls; benchmark qwen3 Ollama at current 2.5k plus synthetic 100k and 1M tiers with declared throughput and memory ceilings; keep mutation refresh bounded and prevent a full rebuild from starving ordinary reads and writes; public SDK owns batching scheduling receipts and recovery while CLI only renders them"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-ydp6"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"pm 2026.8.28 with Ollama 0.32.1, qwen3-embedding:0.6b, LanceDB, embedding_batch_size 32, and 2,592 rich tracker items"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Configure project semantic search for local Ollama qwen3-embedding:0.6b and LanceDB, then run pm reindex --mode semantic --full --progress --json. Observe 2,504 batches for 2,592 inputs and mostly batch size one."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"The provider uses efficient bounded multi-input requests up to an evidence-based byte or token budget, reports effective batching and throughput, and scales through resumable parallel or incremental work without sacrificing deterministic vector order."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"The 3,200-character per-request ceiling equals the 3,200-character per-item limit, reducing nearly every batch to one input despite configured batch size 32."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-9rxu","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-28T20:35:34.770Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-a8zm","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-28T20:35:34.770Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-i25f","kind":"recurs_from","created_at":"2026-08-28T20:35:34.770Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-28T20:35:34.770Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check evidence: searched every status for Ollama embedding batch throughput one-item batches semantic reindex scale vectorization and million-item latency; pm-i25f only proves settings are consumed and no item owns the measured effective-throughput failure caused by equal per-item and per-request ceilings."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"701957d71136e36aec26f66a1024463efc13bed4357b508cdb0559e31b1e6a1c","item_hash_version":2,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"version":{"status":"unavai